[J]EDWare wallboard shows all agents for the queues[ selected]. Agents in every queue will show their current status, and show different status for inbound/outbound calls. If an agent’s soft phone/computer is turned off, the wallboard will also indicate[ this]. The Wallboard offers a quick way for agents to see who is either in their current queue or to see what agents are currently busy.
