> For the month[ of] April only: Receive Dermapen 4 Face & Neck Treatment + An Alginate Mask + IonZyme Machine Treatment for only R1,500 (all inclusive).
We are proud to launch the new Dermapen 4 at Natural[ A]esthetics. We were the first clinic in South Africa to receive the Dermapen 4. So what makes the Dermapen 4 so much better than the[ Dermapen 3] or any other microneedling device?
Dermapen[ 4] has a 16 needle cartridge[ instead of] just[ 12] needles, reaching an inflammatory response at a much quicker rate.
The D[erm]apen[ 4] generates 47.9% more micro-channels than[ Dermapen 3] and 104% more micro-channels than any counterfeit[ device].
[The] D[erm]apen[ 4] generates 1,920 puncture channels per second, which means we can almost double the amount of ser[ums] and act[ives] that we needle into the skin per treatment, than before.
[The] additional 620 micro-channels makes the treatment much quicker and more comfortable than before.
D[erm]apen[ 4] is the only microneedling device with a dedicated scar setting and protocols for revision of deep,[ at]rophic scars; including surgical, burn contracture, striae and post[-acne] scars. Needle penetration can now be increased up to 3.0mm.
AOVN technology, automatically calibrates the motor speed, pressure and penetration for targeted precision.
[The] Dermapen[ 4] is safer than other microneedling[ devices], no dragging or pulling of the skin.
Only Dermapen[ 4] features a unique, medical-grade silicone seal and fluid guard[. The] external cartridge[ is] fortified with a specialised fluid guard that prevents cross contamination to the outer[ cartridge] shell. Safety First![
]Specialised retention valves relieve the build-up of procedural pressure within the D[erm]apen[ 4] needle cartridge.[ The] effect prevents fluid build-up within the needle cavity.[ The] vacuum-like sensation removes the risk of cross contamination whilst ensuring pressure-free[ contact] to the skin during a procedure.
