]I like the POP Beauty Pretty Punk Eyeshadow Palette ($10)…all the pretty colors in[ one] place.
Begin by prepping the entire lid with a light Highlighter shade. I like to use a pale cream or muted white[ color with] a little sparkle.
Move towards the brow bone with a darker plum shade, blending in well with the[ purple] and black[ as] you go. Top the plum shadow with a[ lighter] mag[enta] shade[,] but without going over the brow bone. Only highlighter should be on the brow bone[.]
